WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.310
The mystery of Block 27.

2
00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:20.160
The mystery of Block 27 is that on the site where a large housing estate was planned in the eighties, the land suddenly and without official explanation remained undeveloped, giving rise to many city stories about secret underground tunnels, military facilities and strange phenomena.

3
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:33.680
Although experts explain that the reason for abandoning construction was marshy ground and technical problems, this empty space in the heart of New Belgrade still attracts the attention of lovers of urban legends and mysteries.
